# Generated Compose sources. ComposeGenerator rewrites MainActivity.kt and
# MainScreen.kt on every build, and they differ between the static and the
# dynamic path -- so a tracked copy turns "which mode did I build last?" into a
# reviewable diff, and invites committing one mode by accident.
